          "char_start": 1454,
          "char_end_exclusive": 1571,
          "excerpt": "Keep a strong grip on the steering wheel.  Be aware that the steering may be difficult to turn, but \nyou can turn it.",
          "excerpt_sha256": "cfd88e3ea56763585bc33197e5f89aae482db9820a4a22fd133649f2b8fdae93"
        }
      ],
      "independent_audit": false,
      "current_source_currency_verified": false
    },
    {
      "section": "sec14",
      "part": "C",
      "fact_id": "sec14-F11",
      "statement": "The engine-failure procedure calls for leaving the roadway; it says braking remains possible but may require much greater pedal pressure.",
